<title>USA: AFTER THE BELL - Cascade off 6-1/2 to 80.</title>
<headline>AFTER THE BELL - Cascade off 6-1/2 to 80.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of Cascade Communications Corp fell 6-1/2 to 80 after hours Thursday, while Ascend Communications Inc rose 1-1/8 to 65-1/2, traders said.</p>
<p>After the market closed, Cascade reported third quarter earnings of $0.21 a share, compared to $0.07 a share the previous third quarter.</p>
<p>Ascend reported third quarter earnings of $0.20 a share, including an $0.11 charge, versus $0.06 a share third quarter last year.  </p>
<p>The New York Stock Exchange said that HRE Properties, Seagate Technology Inc and Dallas Semiconductor Corp were unavialable for after hours trade for news.</p>
<p>The NYSE said that session one volume was 112,100 shares, compared to 7,000 shares Wednesday. Session two volume was 313,300 shares versus 2,485,758 shares.</p>
<p>The American Stock Exchange said there was no after-hours activity.</p>
